# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Shopify themes reject non-standard top-level directories.
# Anything here that is not a Shopify theme folder MUST be ignored, or the
# GitHub integration's sync to the store can fail. See .claude/CLAUDE.md.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Claude workflow docs — local only, never synced to Shopify
.claude/
claude_docs/

# Local tooling and deploy scripts — local only, never synced to Shopify
script/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
